 ("Do Chinese machines work in Pakistan?", "Usually, since both countries use 230V single-phase and 400V three-phase at 50Hz. Check the phase matches your supply and avoid 110V US-market versions."),
 ("How do I check a machine without visiting China?", "Ask the seller for a live video call, with the serial number shown next to something dated that day and the machine running under load."),
