 ("Can I ask a Chinese seller for real photos?", "Yes. Most sellers on Alibaba, 1688, Taobao and AliExpress send real photos and short videos of the exact variant if you ask clearly in the platform chat."),
 ("How do I know photos from a seller are recent?", "Ask for a handwritten note with today's date in the frame, or a live video call showing the item next to something dated that day."),
 ("Are Alibaba Verified Suppliers guaranteed to sell good products?", "No. Verification by firms such as SGS or Intertek covers the company. Alibaba's own page says it does not guarantee product authenticity."),
 ("Which reviews are most useful on Chinese sites?", "Recent reviews with buyer photos for the same variant, and the lowest-rated reviews, which show the faults that repeat."),
 ("Can I return a poor item to China from Pakistan?", "It is possible but slow and costly, because it means international shipping. That is why checks before paying matter more than return policies."),
